@startuml fluxo-eventos-normal
!theme plain
autonumber "<b>[00]</b>"
skinparam DefaultFontName "Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
skinparam DefaultFontSize 12
skinparam RoundCorner 8
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

skinparam sequence {
    GroupBorderColor #7F8C8D
    GroupBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
    GroupHeaderFontColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #BDC3C7
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
}

box "Camada de Cliente" #EBF5FB
    actor "Usuário / Web SPA\n(React + TypeScript)" as Client #3498DB
end box

box "Borda & Roteamento" #EAECEE
    participant "API Gateway\n(Node.js / Express)" as Gateway #34495E
end box

box "Microsserviços de Negócio" #E8F8F5
    participant "Image Processing\nService (Produtor)" as ImgService #1ABC9C
    database "PostgreSQL\n(Sequelize ORM)" as DB #16A085
end box

box "Armazenamento Desacoplado" #FEF9E7
    database "Storage / CDN\n(MinIO / S3)" as Storage #F39C12
end box

box "Barramento de Mensageria (Event Bus)" #FDEDEC
    queue "RabbitMQ Exchange\n[pixpro.events] (topic)" as Exchange #E74C3C
    queue "RabbitMQ Fila\n[image-queue] (durable)" as Queue #C0392B
end box

box "Processamento Inteligente & Real-Time" #F4ECF7
    participant "AI Worker Pool\n(Python / PyTorch)" as Worker #8E44AD
    participant "Notification Service\n(WebSocket Server)" as Notif #9B59B6
end box

== 1. Início do Fluxo: Upload e Recepção ==

Client -> Gateway: POST /api/images/upload (multipart/form-data)\n[Headers: Authorization (JWT), X-Correlation-ID]
activate Gateway #34495E

Gateway -> Gateway: Valida Token JWT e aplica Rate-Limiting\nInjeta Header X-User-ID e repassa
Gateway -> ImgService: Proxy HTTP: POST /api/images/upload
activate ImgService #1ABC9C

ImgService -> ImgService: Valida Mime Type (JPEG/PNG/WEBP)\ne tamanho máximo (10MB)

ImgService -> Storage: Salva binário bruto original\n(/storage/raw/usr_123/img_987.jpg)
activate Storage #F39C12
Storage --> ImgService: Confirmação de persistência física (URI)
deactivate Storage

ImgService -> DB: Image.create() / upsert()\n[Status: PENDING, FilePath, UserId]
activate DB #16A085
DB --> ImgService: Registro criado (imageId: img_987)
deactivate DB

== 2. Emissão do Evento no Event Bus ==

ImgService -> Exchange: Publica evento [ImageUploaded]\nRouting Key: image.uploaded\nPayload: { imageId, userId, filePath, originalName }
activate Exchange #E74C3C

Exchange -> Queue: Roteia mensagem para a fila 'image-queue'\n(Persistência garantida no disco)
activate Queue #C0392B
deactivate Exchange

ImgService -->> Gateway: HTTP 202 Accepted\n{ success: true, imageId: "img_987", status: "PENDING" }
deactivate ImgService

Gateway -->> Client: HTTP 202 Accepted\n(Interface do usuário exibe status "Aguardando na Fila")
deactivate Gateway

== 3. Consumo Assíncrono e Inferência de IA ==

Worker -> Queue: Consome mensagem pendente (basic.consume)
activate Worker #8E44AD
Queue --> Worker: Entrega payload do evento [ImageUploaded]
deactivate Queue

Worker -> Storage: Baixa imagem original para análise\nGET /storage/raw/usr_123/img_987.jpg
activate Storage #F39C12
Storage --> Worker: Retorna binário da imagem
deactivate Storage

Worker -> Worker: Executa Pipeline de IA\n• Pré-processamento e normalização\n• Inferência do Modelo (Transfer Learning / MobileNet)\n• Geração de filtros / detecção de objetos

Worker -> Storage: Faz upload do resultado processado\n(/storage/processed/usr_123/img_987_out.jpg)
activate Storage #F39C12
Storage --> Worker: Confirmação de upload do ativo final
deactivate Storage

Worker -> DB: Atualiza metadados no banco relacional\n[Status: PROCESSED, ProcessedPath, AI_Metrics]
activate DB #16A085
DB --> Worker: Registro atualizado com sucesso
deactivate DB

== 4. Notificação em Tempo Real ao Usuário ==

Worker -> Exchange: Publica evento [ImageProcessed]\nRouting Key: image.processed\nPayload: { imageId, userId, processedFilePath, aiMetadata }
activate Exchange #E74C3C

Exchange -> Notif: Roteia evento para o serviço de notificações
deactivate Exchange
activate Notif #9B59B6

Worker -> Queue: Envia ACK de confirmação (basic.ack)\nRemove mensagem original da fila
deactivate Worker

Notif -> Notif: Localiza conexão WebSocket ativa\ndo usuário (userId: usr_123)

Notif -->> Client: Mensagem WebSocket (WSS Push):\n{ type: "IMAGE_READY", imageId: "img_987", url: "..." }
deactivate Notif

Client -> Client: Atualiza dashboard e exibe a imagem processada\n(Zero polling HTTP necessário)

@enduml
